[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_3]
Storm Creatures Protest

[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_3_desc]
Due to a theft case involving a veteran Storm Creature, all Storm Creatures across the country have taken to the streets. From the initial Storm Creature strike to the nationwide riot that now affects all species, the racial conflicts, which should have been concealed by all means, have finally erupted. Since the “Storm of March”, Free Equestria is once again on the brink of a cliff, teetering on the edge.

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_3]
风暴兽的抗议

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_3_desc]
因一场涉及风暴兽老兵的盗窃案，现在全国的风暴兽都开始走上了街头。从一开始的风暴兽罢工，到现在波及所有种族的全国性骚乱。曾经被各种方式试图掩盖的种族矛盾终于还是爆发了。自“三月风暴”后，自由小马利亚再一次站在了悬崖边上，摇摇欲坠。
